&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do you thrive in a fast-paced environment, where you gain a tremendous amount of responsibility? Do you want to be part of an exceptional entrepreneurial team with young, motivated and extremely driven people? And are you curious or passionate about people? If so, you might be our next B2B Marketing Graduate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;CFO Insights is Northern Europe’s largest CFO forum and aims to connect and develop CFOs, finance leaders, and tomorrow&#39;s innovators by addressing the issues of the future CFO. We are connecting more than 11,000 professionals from more than 15 countries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
