&lt;p&gt;Do you thrive in a fast-paced environment, where you gain a tremendous amount of responsibility? Do you want to be part of an exceptional entrepreneurial team with motivated and extremely driven people? Are you curious or passionate about people? If so, you might be our next Graduate Head Hunter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRtechX is a world leading HRtech community, connecting industry executives, entrepreneurs and professionals. We are a start-up on a growth journey who help leaders evolve and create stronger businesses through people and technology. We aim to address the challenges and opportunities for HR and HR Tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We bring together the most influential executives, investors, and entrepreneurs to share their insights on how technology will shape the future of HR, as well as forge long lasting partnerships and client relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRtechX is part of United Media which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 8 media companies and acquired one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Graduate Head Hunter, you get the unique opportunity to be a key player in building the greatest brand within Insurtech. By providing you with the ownership of our recruiting, we want to constantly push you out of your comfort zone ensuring you become an expert. You’ll be working out of our HQ in London and to ensure a never-ending growth curve, we provide you with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to get operational experience in a start-up where both your work and the results are highly tangible and matter to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to work closely with the CEO on our recruiting strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited growth potential in our company - we strongly believe in and we have a track record of promoting internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12-month internship with the possibility of a full-time role either in recruitment or other departments of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Watch this &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxjgL64czRY&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt; with our founder to learn more about our thoughts on recruiting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will vary; however, some of them will be to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with the CEO all the weekly strategy sessions and lunch meetings with candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage potential candidates for outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for the first stage of the recruitment process. (CV Screening)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of the Recruitment Software, Greenhouse:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renew and update job postings via the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update the job description to attract more candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure synchronization between FirstMind and Greenhouse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
